{"unit_id":"X-noesis__dsh-paste-packer#card-zh","repo":"X-noesis/dsh-paste-packer","commit":"bbe7c9dc0f99065a025215193f3a133f6fa224fb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paste-packer 是面向 DSH Web 和桌面客户端的粘贴整理插件。它在输入框上方显示粘贴卡片，把超过 20 行的文本收纳为引用芯片，并在发送时通过触发源 codec 还原全文。用户可以在卡片内预览 Markdown 文本、展开原文回到输入框，或移除这段内容。插件还处理多语言标签和本地保存，适合经常向 DSH 提交长日志、代码或文档的用户。无需 API Key 或外部账号；原文保存在浏览器内存和 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:220-259","client.js:790-939","client.js:973-1021"]}
{"unit_id":"X-noesis__dsh-paste-packer#card-en","repo":"X-noesis/dsh-paste-packer","commit":"bbe7c9dc0f99065a025215193f3a133f6fa224fb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-paste-packer folds pastes over 20 lines into reference chips in DSH web and desktop composers. Users can preview, expand, or remove each card. A trigger codec restores saved text when sending. Paste content stays in browser memory and localStorage; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:220-259","client.js:790-939","client.js:973-1021"]}
